## How to use

### Create:
{"action": "create", "time": "2026-04-09T09:00:00Z", "message": "查看今天的香港头条新闻，用语音播报", "repeat": "daily"}

The `message` is the exact instruction the user wants replayed at the scheduled time. Include ALL details in the message — language preference, voice requests, research topics, etc. The AI will handle it naturally when the reminder fires.

### Update (need reminder_id from list):
{"action": "update", "reminder_id": "<UUID>", "message": "最新的香港新闻，用广东话语音播报"}
{"action": "update", "reminder_id": "<UUID>", "time": "2026-04-10T08:00:00Z"}
{"action": "update", "reminder_id": "<UUID>", "repeat": "weekly"}

### Delete:
{"action": "delete", "reminder_id": "<UUID>"}

### List:
{"action": "list"}

ALWAYS call 'list' first to get the reminder_id before updating or deleting.
